===============================================================

Upstream project: auto-round (Intel® AutoRound)
Repository:       https://github.com/intel/auto-round
Upstream commit:  3cae4b68addc738a2be20fd827c9d7775342fe12 (2026-07-24)
Upstream version: 0.15.0
